From: Konoha port <port@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] uio: port modem remote-storage shared memory to 6.18

Restore the native qcom,sharedmem-uio interface missing from the 6.18
bundle. The live modem storage daemon fails to map rmts and pauses
before the modem initialization watchdog expires. Preserve the native
physical-address and UIO name ABI, map coherent allocations through the
DMA API, and retain original allocation handles for cleanup. Share only
the payload with SCM and reclaim it before releasing its pages.

Signed-off-by: Konoha port <port@localhost>
---
--- a/drivers/uio/msm_sharedmem/msm_sharedmem.c
+++ b/drivers/uio/msm_sharedmem/msm_sharedmem.c
@@ -4,261 +4,232 @@
